OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral for man who died from
OL,4,Asingle stab wound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA funeral for a keen cricketer who died
OL,7,Ffrom a single stab wound has been held.
OL,9,FJamie Evans was described as "kind,
OL,10,Floving, funny and competitive" during
OL,11,Fthe service held earlier at Bradwell
OL,12,FCrematorium in Staffordshire.
OL,14,FThe 20-year-old from Stone, died in
OL,15,Fhospital after being found injured in
OL,16,FNewcastle-under-Lyme following a crash
OL,17,Finvolving a Ford Fiesta and a parked
OL,18,FAudi.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
