OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral for man who died from
OL,4,Asingle stab wound
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men - Corey Hughes, 20, and Connor
OL,7,FEdward Cartlidge, 22 - have been
OL,8,Fcharged with Evans' murder. Hughes is
OL,9,Falso accused of possession of a knife
OL,10,Fin a public place, Staffordshire Police
OL,11,Fsaid.
